[13.539201, "o", "2. Download the LoRA adapter '\"'\"'dominguesm/xlm-roberta-base-lora-language-detection'\"'\"' \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[13.539228, "o", "> "]
[13.539273, "o", "3. Configure the base model with 20 language classes (not the default 2)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[13.539298, "o", "> "]
[13.539359, "o", "4. Save the configured model and tokenizer to '\"'\"'/app/model_cache/xlm-roberta-base'\"'\"'\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[13.539369, "o", "> "]
[13.539406, "o", "5. Apply the LoRA adapter to the base model\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[13.539442, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[13.539449, "o", "> "]
[13.539509, "o", "6. Merge the LoRA adapter with the base model and save the merged model to '\"'\"'/app/merged_model/'\"'\"'\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[13.539517, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[13.539549, "o", "> "]
[13.539624, "o", "7. Test language detection on the following 10 test samples and save results to '\"'\"'/app/detection_results.json'\"'\"':\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
