[183.838602, "o", "\r\n# 5. Check all confidences are high (>= 0.90)\r\nfor r in results:\r\n    assert r['confidence'] >= 0.90, f'Low confidence: {r}'\r\nprint(f'  [OK] All confidences >= 0.90')\r\n\r\nprint('All checks passed.')\r\n\" 2>&1 — approved\r\n  ⚙ bash cd /app && python3 -c \" import json, os, torch from transformers impor…\r\n    ✗ bash — exit 1\r\n  qwen3.6-35b — 11 tool call(s) so far\r\n[approval] write /app/verify.py (+73 −0) [new file] — approved\r\n  ⚙ write /app/verify.py\r\n    ✓ write /app/verify.py (+73 −0)\r\n  qwen3.6-35b — 12 tool call(s) so far\r\n[approval] bash: cd /app && python3 verify.py 2>&1 — approved\r\n  ⚙ bash cd /app && python3 verify.py 2>&1\r\n    ✓ bash — exit 0\r\n  qwen3.6-35b — 13 tool call(s) so far\r\n  │ Now clean up scratch scripts:\r\n[approval] bash: rm /app/setup_model.py /app/verify.py — approved\r\n  ⚙ bash rm /app/setup_model.py /app/verify.py\r\n    ✓ bash — exit 0\r\n  qwen3.6-35b — 14 tool call(s) so far\r\nAll checks pass. Here's the verification summary:\r\n\r\n| Requirement | "]
